/-!
# Finite witnesses for the first Hall--Janko radical

Thirty-two words in the fixed radical generators are indexed in the already
certified Sylow table. The two lists of eight indices propose the quaternion
and dihedral factors, with a product decomposition for every radical element.
The comparisons, coverage, and group laws are proved in the adjacent modules.

Generated by `source/Generate.py` from the retained ATLAS J2G1-p100B0
permutations. These data alone assert no group-theoretic facts.
Source: Aschbacher--Smith F.1.12(I)(10)--(11), printed p.263 (PDF p.274).
-/

